            <div xml:id="d588">

                <pb facs="0685" n="613" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg613"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 5082/107.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Special Commissioner Buchanan to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Willemstadt</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-02-14"><hi rendition="#italic">February 14,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Protocol signed yesterday at Miraflores in presence of President and Cabinet.
                    Sail early Wednesday on <hi rendition="#italic">Des Moines</hi> for Guantanamo.
                    The <hi rendition="#italic">Marietta</hi> will take me from Guantanamo to
                    Washington, where expect to arrive night 26th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buchanan.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
